PROJECT: Axie Infinity

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Blockchain Gaming / Play-to-Earn / NFT-based Turn-based Strategy Game / Metaverse Platform (HIGH) [Whitepaper v1.1, https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/axie-infinity/profile]
Secondary Sector: Appchain Infrastructure / EVM Sidechain Ecosystem / DeFi (AMM DEX, Bridge, Staking) / NFT Marketplace / Naming Service (HIGH) [Ronin Network Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/; Ronin Ecosystem Page, https://roninchain.com/ecosystem]
Primary Chain: Ronin Network (EVM Sidechain, Chain ID 2020) (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Architecture, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/architecture/overview; Chainlist Ronin, https://chainlist.org/chain/2020]
Supported Chains: Ethereum Mainnet (Settlement Layer, Bridge Destination); Ronin Testnet Saigon (Chain ID 2021) (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge; Ronin Docs Testnet, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/testnet/overview]
Sources: https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/; https://docs.roninchain.com/; https://roninchain.com/ecosystem; https://messari.io/asset/axie-infinity/profile

## External Dependencies

Dependency Name: Ethereum
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: Settlement layer untuk finalitas bridge, keamanan token ERC-20 asli (AXS, SLP), validator set awal PoA, oracle anchor (Chainlink feeds di Ethereum mainnet dirujuk)
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Ethereum
Related Technology Component: Ronin Bridge (Lock/Mint), AXS/SLP ERC-20 Contracts, Chainlink Price Feeds
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge]; [Whitepaper v1.1, https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/]; [Chainlink Blog Ronin, https://blog.chain.link/chainlink-price-feeds-ronin-network/]

Dependency Name: Ronin Bridge
Dependency Type: Bridge
Purpose: Canonical bridge untuk transfer aset dua arah (ETH, USDC, AXS, SLP, NFT) antara Ethereum dan Ronin; threshold signature validator set
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live (dengan upgrade keamanan pasca-Maret 2022)
Related Entity: Ronin Bridge
Related Technology Component: Ronin Bridge Contracts (Ethereum & Ronin), Bridge Operator/Relayer, Emergency Pause Multisig
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge]; [Blog Ronin Bridge Reopening, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-bridge-reopening]; [CertiK Audit Ronin Bridge, https://www.certik.com/projects/ronin-network]

Dependency Name: Chainlink
Dependency Type: Oracle
Purpose: Price Feeds untuk AXS, SLP, RON, WETH, USDC (digunakan Katana DEX, lending protocols); VRF untuk randomness game
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Chainlink
Related Technology Component: Katana DEX (pricing), Game Server (VRF), Ronin Bridge (price reference)
Sources: (HIGH) [Chainlink Blog Ronin Integration, https://blog.chain.link/chainlink-price-feeds-ronin-network/]; [Ronin Docs Oracle, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/oracles/chainlink]; [Axie Docs Game Mechanics, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/]

Dependency Name: Google Cloud Platform (GCP)
Dependency Type: Cloud / Infrastructure
